Mon Aug  3 12:56:35 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 1.0.0:
  * jump to entered offset (go/gO).
  * search (/).
    + ASCII search (A-/).
  * fixed a nasty bug with undoing multi-cursor deletes.
  * reverse-till T (Tm/T0/Tf).

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Jun 09 07:21:40 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 0.2.4:
  * clicking a tab with the mouse now opens that buffer.
  * C-j/C-l to switch buffers now works in select mode.
  * color555 translation to hex color codes in the inspector is
    now more precise.
  * inspector can now be closed with escape.
  * OSC 6 (current document) is now set when opening/switching
    files.
  * UX when running without arguments is now more clear.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed May 06 05:56:04 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 0.2.3:
  * add gn/gp next/previous buffer keybinds.
  * update unsaved changes alert.

